# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated Flutter web bundle.
#
# `server/public/` is dart2js output, not source. It is committed only because
# vercel.json sets `outputDirectory: server/public`, so Vercel deploys straight
# from the repository; deploy_web.yml regenerates and commits it on every push
# to main. Nothing here is hand-edited.
#
# `linguist-generated` keeps it out of GitHub's language stats and collapses it
# in pull requests. `-diff` stops git rendering a textual diff of a 6 MB
# minified bundle that no human will read.
#
# CodeScene analyses this path as if it were source and reports main.dart.js as
# unhealthy. Git attributes do not reach CodeScene; that exclusion is set in the
# CodeScene project configuration. See docs/codescene.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
server/public/** linguist-generated=true -diff
